Description: End-to-end entity resolution (deduplication and record linkage) via a
    nine-stage pipeline: loading, field diagnosis, blocking, per-field NA-aware
    similarity, adaptive weighted combination (Fellegi-Sunter or ARI weights),
    multiple clustering methods (HC, PAM, Louvain, Leiden, Graph Coloring),
    consensus merging, and evaluation by ARI and B-cubed F-score.
    Includes a full ablation framework comparing weight conditions
    (uniform, Fellegi-Sunter EM, full-data ARI, CV-learned ARI) and blocking
    conditions (no-block vs blocked), plus wrappers for external deep learning
    baselines (DeepMatcher, Ditto/BERT) and probabilistic baselines (Splink)
    via Python system calls.
